      "content": "i feel like i’m losing my mind at work. everything is starting to feel so targeted. first it was the cafeteria menu changing to only things i’m allergic to, then my payroll email was delayed by like two days for no reason, and now hr rescheduled my one-on-one for the third time this week. it’s all so weirdly specific. i feel like they are trying to push me out or something. how do i even start documenting these little things so i can prove what's actually happening?",
